  "body": "The property has recently been subdivided from its original 875m² section, meaning the current Capital Value (CV) reflects the former, larger parcel of land rather than the property as it stands today. The new title is expected to be issued shortly, with updated council records and a revised valuation to follow. In the meantime, the existing CV is no longer an appropriate guide to value, and our vendors are prepared to listen to the market, and their clear instruction is to present all offers for their consideration.  \r\n\r\n* Sweeping Coastal & Bay Views\r\n* Flexible Living for Work, Guests, or Shared Living\r\n* Direct Access to Whale Cove & Coastal Adventures\r\n\r\nPerched high above the coastline in a private, sun-drenched position, this beautifully modernised home captures breathtaking views stretching across Red Beach, Orewa, the bay, and beyond to the rolling hills of Wainui. Offering a relaxed coastal lifestyle with plenty of flexibility, this is a property designed for those who value outlook, location, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is centred around light-filled open-plan living, where expansive windows and seamless flow to the deck ensure the spectacular views are always on display. The modern kitchen connects effortlessly to the living spaces, while the wood-burning fireplace creates the perfect setting for cosy winter evenings after a day on the water or exploring the coast.\r\n\r\nThe main bedroom enjoys direct deck access and stunning water views, while a second bedroom and updated bathroom complete the upper level. The current owners often speak of falling asleep to the sound of the ocean and waking to sparkling sunrises across the bay, a daily reminder of just how special this location is.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers a highly versatile space with its own lounge, kitchenette, bedroom, bathroom, study area, and sunroom. Whether you're working from home, hosting guests, accommodating flatmates, or simply wanting additional separation between living spaces, the layout offers options to suit a range of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nOutside, the landscaped terraced grounds have been designed for easy-care living, allowing more time to enjoy everything the surrounding coastline has to offer. With direct access to Whale Cove from the bottom of the street, morning swims, paddleboarding, kayaking adventures, and coastal walks can become part of your everyday routine.\r\n\r\nPrivate, peaceful, and beautifully presented, this is a home that offers an enviable coastal lifestyle in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nCall us for a private viewing or we will see you at the Open Homes. \r\nProperty Documents can be downloaded here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/RRD3",
